    {
      "id": "f4ec3b93-7504-45da-9a9b-cac03afde72c",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e ligue a pergunta ao momento do pedido.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "acc8e091-35ba-45b7-8e3b-9dffd6912ddb",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>¿Qué le pongo?</strong> é uma pergunta comum do atendente quando chega a sua vez de pedir.</p><p>Nesse contexto, <strong>le pongo</strong> funciona como “o que posso servir?” ou “o que vai querer?”.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "6fbabdbd-4135-4f35-8e21-4d779f4f5dad",
      "title": "Escute e observe o pedido em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "78fa0836-e741-4338-be75-a319c772dc1a",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute um pedido curto de bebida.</p><p><strong>Para mí, un café, por favor.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Para mim, um café, por favor.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/fd6477da666c48dca0d380cbdafff505_b03-cafe-por-favor.mp3?Expires=1794099496&Signature=L5Mob6GgwjWQ3yD16C-zu8lHmE4Rf6pa3S-We~n2SvJfG9IvOVbuxZ98b2werkCcQdHRX09QPHWsy0NvNwZzHtHbg-bqo9AhlDglNOGrsl~9rhCEqDw6~ORBlOq1tEj2hLFHEm3aserumUExXftHSpbN60p7itnFzXHjarORl~3tCUvagOHZEWRVCa3ZMmjcBY7jagXIO4Ltk25Sl3YX8kTZAd-K08N2d0taKzV3kt3-E7nyz-jYfmrFXrhltGf2yeRmWY0nwqEhmWPnNsQS5ns2-SRDAadTxhszzxbCcCNVtiO0U~lV8rvJUZTj4555ksi3cwRWCA2h7ecCzcc8Lw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4c59461d-ce5b-4a48-9930-f88994f22921",
      "title": "Leia e observe as duas opções mais comuns depois do pedido de café.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c0c8f8b9-a400-4d3d-b74f-35222717b9b9",
          "textContent": "<p>Depois de pedir um café, você pode ouvir <strong>¿Solo o con leche?</strong></p><p><strong>solo</strong> indica café puro. <strong>con leche</strong> indica café com leite.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f49c0e2d-27db-4cc1-97c1-f59cb0220170",
      "title": "Escute e observe outra opção de pedido em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "e992b488-63f6-44a4-93e0-88bf80eef32c",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute outra opção de bebida.</p><p><strong>Un refresco de naranja, por favor.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Um refrigerante de laranja, por favor.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/34cde660ebf147ee87e8be378fc099fe_b05-refresco-de-naranja.mp3?Expires=1794099496&Signature=1LAF-0HDdZdVouhB~Zx9CHenNaufnlrdJ6Tm9zsaRKR6uGvRRT8tsK96oQAEnNd0mbABRnjT2LlAgZjGoXaARhhE0i52pMWr3Ujg8relPvxitteqMvQ2dYrylK1gXoU3QIQ-28GAhRh340ZLrC5THQyYnDAZRYJ~QwbbtCEEmZNy-U~abFIIfQwijPXH3FRX8kzG5Aamcv2v1hhl3tl2b2vFfPzoxODC9yI6t8ubqImtFA2zUuOq1ZZEwqlxZTv1Ms7ifZ~XJ36cIRDLqGUVAILCDqZlZUs2RIp72ZICfgGiFK0gPzJ-qP6oOlcfrRlnjq5XsPwM6QsJB7xQR9ppXg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
